# Sales Data Analysis Using Excel 📊

## Project Overview
This project analyzes sales data using Microsoft Excel
to identify trends and understand business performance.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Excel
- Pivot Tables
- Charts and Data Visualization

## Project Objectives
- Analyze overall sales performance.
- Identify top-selling products.
- Compare sales across categories.
- Present findings using charts.

## Key Learnings
- Data organization and cleaning.
- Sales analysis.
- Data visualization.

## Project Files
- Sales Analysis Excel workbook (.xlsx)
